Naming a builder, writing into Cash, adding server keys.

6
00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:27.671
Approvers come from the roles already in the account.

7
00:00:31.642 --> 00:00:35.772
With one admin, K-φ's own team confirms Build changes.

8
00:00:35.822 --> 00:00:39.531
Never work around it with a second account for the same person.

